**Title:** Gentle Whispers of the Shore

**Description:** Drift into a world of tranquility with tonight's sleep story featuring Finn, an eleven-year-old boy who embodies quiet bravery on a coastal shoreline adventure. Accompanied by his playful otter companion, Ripple, Finn explores the serene beauty of the sea as the sun sets, creating a symphony of serenity. With each step along the sandy shore, Finn finds joy in small discoveries, like polished shells and the gentle rise of the tide. This audio experience is crafted to soothe your soul, calm your mind, and lull you into a restful sleep, guiding you to a peaceful place where the rhythm of the ocean and the gentle embrace of the night help you release anxiety and embrace calm.

